<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has expanded its military footprint in southern Lebanon, building a 90km network of roads and opening new bases, while Hezbollah continues artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Israeli strikes have wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65-year-old retired engineer, and French investigators are probing alleged Israeli war crimes in the area. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon, and protests against Israeli attacks have taken place in Sweden. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9IYjhkczdHclJ2Ni0xX2pBb1pKZGRkcUhaZTN1b1NpcGw4NFh2T1FDdjJKdmY4RGY3Y3lXWDFuclE3S2dtcXRCMXRaZHV2cUN5d01ocGU4b1NRUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wtae.com/article/trump-iran-war-effectively-over-qatar/74379933&quot;&gt;wtae.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://keyt.com/news/national-world/cnn-world/2026/11/09/us-and-iran-are-quietly-negotiating-as-middle-east-remains-on-edge-heres-what-to-know/&quot;&gt;keyt.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dailypress.com/2026/11/09/trump-iran-us-war/&quot;&gt;dailypress.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.chicagotribune.com/2026/11/09/trump-iran-war-2/&quot;&gt;chicagotribune.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.clevelandjewishnews.com/jns/they-must-listen-to-us-israeli-envoy-to-un-in-geneva-tells-jns-days-before/article_ac2c1748-6850-585b-8c86-0a835d662a50.html&quot;&gt;clevelandjewishnews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQbll6NWpZZzlkcjJpQXdHUDc1RmZ4T2xDRDhUU0VPMG9WbC1FVzFsa2lnR1FzcXo5a041QzNOZkNGU2VObDJQTURTNE9DdlB3YjRNOHVLT1d6czZUVUtycXV2ZVIyblJqODFqS1p1bS1wQTZpV191UjFjNVQyZm82WlVQRjE4VTRW?oc=5&quot;&gt;CounterVortex&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lebanon Democrat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOSkl0ay0wb0wtRzdDODRnY1JiTFVILWRSYzVTT096N1pnUGluTWtlRi1oVDVJTDZNSWhyRWxaUVdmSXZCdnpsYXFRV3F4QUJySF8tbkNmRGZzSXIyR1pDTTg3emM3dFJzaGpqT1JqaUFEUl9DNUpRSXBzUExEVXZ6anpOOWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE9rdkwtaGx3ZlpDb2FXNF9xTVJZbnk2bDdTZFFmM1B0RXdleEs5MWpkVmJXRC1TMDZ2RzV6SkRqX3lmOGhWQThmZzBR?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
